<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 2.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 2.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 April 2		April 1</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.092		  4.961</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  18.742		 17.828</p>
<p>Cash balance		  23.834		 22.789</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,290.292	     5,288.590</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $23 million were issued and $157 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
